{"title":"深圳市发展和改革委员会关于开展深圳市 2024年重大项目计划增补工作的通知","date":"2024-06-07","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:26.25pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">深圳市发展和改革委员会关于开展深圳市</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:26.25pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:\r\n.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年重大项目计划增补工作的通知</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:26.25pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<br />\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br />\r\n\t<!--[endif]--></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:26.25pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">各区人民政府（新区、合作区管委会）、市政府直属各单位、各有关建设单位：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">根据市委市政府工作部署，为进一步扩大有效投资，更好发挥重大项目在&ldquo;稳投资、促投资&rdquo;工作的支撑作用，有效推动全年固定资产投资高质量增长，提前谋划布局&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;重大项目储备，现开展深圳市<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年重大项目计划增补工作。有关事项通知如下：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:19.2pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">一、申报要求</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">本次重大项目计划增补项目须符合我市产业发展导向，对我市经济社会发展具有重大影响和带动作用，优先支持正在开展前期工作、今明两年能够开工建设的重大项目。增补项目的具体申报分类、申报条件、申报材料等要求，详见《深圳市<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年重大项目计划申报指南》。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:19.2pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">二、申报方式</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">本次重大项目计划申报全部采取网络申报，请项目单位通过广东省政务服务网<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>深圳市发展和改革委员会窗口统一进入，具体网址为：<span lang=\"EN-US\">https://fw.fgw.sz.gov.cn/app-portal/,</span>登录后在事项列表中选择&ldquo;深圳市年度重大项目计划确认&rdquo;进行申报，而后进入深圳市智慧投资项目管理平台进行在线办理。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">各区政府投资主管部门、市直行业主管部门亦可直接向我委推荐，经审核后符合要求的推荐项目，项目单位也应及时登录深圳市智慧投资项目管理平台完善项目信息。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:19.2pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">三、其他事宜</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">（一）申报时间。本次重大项目计划增补申报时间自发文之日起至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">21</span>日<span lang=\"EN-US\">18:00</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:33.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:19.2pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-ligatures:none\">（二）咨询电话。相关业务问题，请按重大项目行业分类咨询：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:19.2pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">现代产业：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:19.2pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">88127562</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">、<span lang=\"EN-US\">88127306<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:19.2pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">基础设施：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:19.2pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">88127561</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">、<span lang=\"EN-US\">88127563<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;line-height:19.2pt;mso-pagination:widow-orph