/p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph;text-indent:31.5pt;line-height:27.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;letter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:\r\nwidow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">附件：<span lang=\"EN-US\">1.</span>深圳市<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年重大项目计划申报指南<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:27.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202406/%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%871.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 400px;\" />&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal;mso-pagination:\r\nwidow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">深圳市智慧投资项目管理平台年度重大项目计划（含月报）用户手册<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\nline-height:30.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.75pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.